  "details": "Some groups being open to certain groups of people, or certain audiences, members being able to create any instance they want poses a problem. Making it so only certain people can open worlds also kills the amount of activity a group can have. I propose a feature be made so that groups can blacklist certain worlds to make it easy to maintain what the groups stand for and the audience they want to have given the kind of audience they want to go for.",
